[18.666086, "o", "\u001b[29A\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[90m  Provider: openai\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[K\u001b[90mModel: gpt-5.6-luna\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[K\u001b[90mEndpoint: https://api.openai.com/v1\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[K\u001b[90mWorking directory: /tmp/ami-demo-oDujj8\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[K\u001b[90mSession: session-20261112-104804-430-0\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[K\u001b[90mPermissions: auto-allow\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[90m  Tip: Run \u001b[1m/model\u001b[22m to switch models on the fly.\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[2m\u2298 Indexing skipped: no project root found\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255m > In the current directory only, create a self-contained Python file named parallel_demo.py with no\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[2G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255mnetwork or external dependencies that runs an embarrassingly parallel workload of deterministic \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255mtasks, measuring a serial version and a concurrent.futures ThreadPoolExecutor version; make each \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[5G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255m include a short sleep so threading is measurably faster, verify both versions return identical \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255mresults, and print one concise readable summary showing the results match, both timings, and the \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255mspeedup. Run the file and leave the final comparison as a clear terminal result, not a real-time \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255manimation. \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;208m\u25b6 \u001b[39m \u001b[2m\u2234 Thinking #1\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[4G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;208m\u001b[39m\u001b[38;5;35m\u25cf